[{"title":"再和前韵 其一","author":"彭汝砺","text":"天上参差殿阁开，孤城纵望兴悠哉。\n江湖凫鹤多如雪，总拟将迎杖锡来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50173,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再和前韵 其二","author":"彭汝砺","text":"世间复见大威雄，把定乾坤一瞬中。\n郢市未能知白雪，弋人何敢望冥鸿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50174,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再和前韵 其三","author":"彭汝砺","text":"生涯泛泛寄浮鸥，老矣华簪笑未投。\n宛转枕前清夜梦，还随修水近山流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50175,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答圆相庵主人","author":"彭汝砺","text":"神巫作舞乞丰年，宛转灵场咫尺间。\n一雨坐令天下遍，无心随得似云閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50176,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和提举送淮长老住延寿寺 其一","author":"彭汝砺","text":"少时见说饱丛林，宴坐垂年味更深。\n月印夜潭非有意，云归秋嶂亦无心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50177,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和提举送淮长老住延寿寺 其二","author":"彭汝砺","text":"非爱山林避市廛，一枝安隐寄残年。\n新泉遍作人天供，不用诸方五味禅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50178,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和提举送淮长老住延寿寺 其三","author":"彭汝砺","text":"天地悠悠共故乡，眼前差别亦多方。\n欲知道济庵前路，俱是将军旧战场。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50179,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑛首坐访及颁示四颂而有选佛选官俱第一之句既赓元韵因寄末章 其一","author":"彭汝砺","text":"如梦如泡如露身，簿书埋没老埃尘。\n上人因把诗装点，可学寒梅卖弄人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50180,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑛首坐访及颁示四颂而有选佛选官俱第一之句既赓元韵因寄末章 其二","author":"彭汝砺","text":"马驹元似出西江，吾姓音声亦似庞。\n空乏本来无一物，珍奇新得璧双双。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50181,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑛首坐访及颁示四颂而有选佛选官俱第一之句既赓元韵因寄末章 其三","author":"彭汝砺","text":"山河大地一无穷，总在维摩丈室中。\n向火一杯茶似雪，莫嫌居士没家风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50182,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑛首坐访及颁示四颂而有选佛选官俱第一之句既赓元韵因寄末章 其四","author":"彭汝砺","text":"有顶须弥寄一尘，山河全现法王身。\n众生与我俱无别，师亦难为第二人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50183,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答云居佛印 其一","author":"彭汝砺","text":"不道云居行路难，临歧留约待初寒。\n先烦寄语诸尊宿，莫笑庞公祇野冠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50184,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答云居佛印 其二","author":"彭汝砺","text":"人间六月日如丹，见说云居蚤自寒。\n他日游山看蜡屐，终朝临水濯尘冠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50185,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江上","author":"彭汝砺","text":"波澜浮动月翻翻，细雨吹风忽在门。\n溪上酒家何处所，青灯明灭见渔村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50186,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄观音能老 其一","author":"彭汝砺","text":"踏水穿云入翠萝，情知不恋旧时窠。\n巉岩头角今须别，试比黄龙较几多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50187,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄观音能老 其二","author":"彭汝砺","text":"缥缈烟云水石间，生涯见说足安闲。\n更烦细问黄龙看，合在尘劳合在山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50188,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余宿鄂州崇阳县之麻步使仆问途曰西去七里至南楼山而余诗遂称南楼及过山有叟云彼南劳山余笑曰培塿之土人妄名为山又妄名为南劳予妄问彼又妄应予又妄听又从而妄言是俱为一幻然山为山而已曰南劳亦可曰南楼亦可而彼皆无所与物有故常予亦从其旧而已因复作偈寄心师师当为予一笑","author":"彭汝砺","text":"高山人唤作南楼，便作篇章说事由。\n却得村翁亲说破，南劳即不是南楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50189,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送观音能师去黄龙","author":"彭汝砺","text":"天地悠悠共故乡，鬓毛苒苒几星霜。\n的然积翠家风好，行矣黄龙山路长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50190,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"彭汝砺","text":"抵虚投隙废精神，世态纷纷日更新。\n得丧是非浑一梦，不知误却几多人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50191,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桐柏道中见农人有戴其父谒庙者","author":"彭汝砺","text":"戴天虽重莫辞勤，力尽何能报一分。\n我有此诚嗟不待，自怜终世不如君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50192,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中伏离襄极热老母为动念既行日有微云时作甘雨因赋是诗","author":"彭汝砺","text":"浮生处处托慈云，大热清凉一变新。\n愿力更能为法雨，欲令四海总无尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50193,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"女娲庙","author":"彭汝砺","text":"高山婉转一千寻，百拜灵祠泪满襟。\n今日几人能似帝，辛勤长有补天心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50194,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉招正仲","author":"彭汝砺","text":"槎头鳊熟物且旨，竹叶酒清人可思。\n临水登高终日待，此心祇有楚山知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50195,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和正仲提举","author":"彭汝砺","text":"败谷死灰枯木枝，禅那一味说无思。\n优昙昨夜花开了，碧眼胡儿知未知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50196,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和舅氏和仲游朱萝洞 其一","author":"彭汝砺","text":"杳霭冲融烟雨间，攀跻经涉几重关。\n洞天见说非人世，何似蓬莱海上山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50197,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和舅氏和仲游朱萝洞 其二","author":"彭汝砺","text":"松竹山风吹我衣，溪寒细雨落霏霏。\n琴声彷佛窥幽趣，若到无弦意转微。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50198,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和舅氏和仲游朱萝洞 其三","author":"彭汝砺","text":"村北村南几往回，云中咫尺见崔嵬。\n今时不似维摩诘，指掌能移妙喜来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50199,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏招史秘校","author":"彭汝砺","text":"春风醉死百金瓯，不记颠衣笑史鳅。\n更欲画船留瞬息，花间一饮破离忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50200,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢德华惠牡丹因招同官会饮","author":"彭汝砺","text":"交情淡薄爱天真，亲寄韶容到窭贫。\n便乞诸公城壁饮，风前同醉一枝春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50201,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答诚之见和","author":"彭汝砺","text":"尘土相欺老病身，韶华似亦厌清贫。\n且须一饮城头晚，醉送莺花万里春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50202,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"都官以诗求菊栽次韵谢之","author":"彭汝砺","text":"新诗来乞菊花秧，种植还须近宋墙。\n待得来年花烂烂，约君颠倒醉秋香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50203,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以寒来送菊本都官复示诗见督次韵谢之","author":"彭汝砺","text":"祇因霜雪妒萌芽，不意新诗谯惜花。\n芳本无心恋贫窭，迎风争入相公家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50204,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和庭佐韵","author":"彭汝砺","text":"议论优优喜自得，簿书故故来相关。\n夜深归梦无羁束，绕尽南轩一席间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50205,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戊寅城上闲步因各赋诗","author":"彭汝砺","text":"城外江山照眼明，城头花草弄春晴。\n欲歌风物无才思，须约诸公载酒行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50206,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和济叔城上数篇 梅","author":"彭汝砺","text":"城外人家梅子枝，细花欲出蒂开时。\n光迷路径雪应妒，香满幽林莺未知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50207,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和济叔城上数篇 草","author":"彭汝砺","text":"草色初成城上春，春风步履衬浮云。\n踏青未得游人见，烟日遮藏待使君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50208,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和济叔城上数篇 柏","author":"彭汝砺","text":"落尽桃花梅子英，一枝霜雪自光荣。\n猛怜夜月纷纷影，频听秋风细细声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50209,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和济叔城上数篇 芙蓉","author":"彭汝砺","text":"春风桃李绣朱阑，更插芙蓉待薄寒。\n花萼未成驺从起，异时空作憩棠看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50210,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"侍亲游池有感寄伯兄时伯兄下第南归","author":"彭汝砺","text":"身世几何长百忧，尘埃相望转悠悠。\n移尊稍欲临池饮，眼看波涛泪亦流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50211,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答佛印语","author":"彭汝砺","text":"十方同是一空虚，饮啄随时祇自如。\n旧日事来长是笑，而今和笑没工夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50212,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与佛印夜坐","author":"彭汝砺","text":"纱帽筇枝鬓发苍，笑谈中夜共寒缸。\n诸人不用称居士，我是彭公不姓庞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50213,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿圆通寄佛印","author":"彭汝砺","text":"丈室灯寒夜未眠，竹间流水听涓涓。\n试看石耳峰头月，何似云居天上圆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50214,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次友人韵 其一","author":"彭汝砺","text":"朝车暮马走尘埃，眼疾昏眵洗不开。\n门外柳阴清似水，十分留著待公来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50215,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次友人韵 其二","author":"彭汝砺","text":"丁宁风伯莫相催，莫放船头容易开。\n更语水边鱼与雁，不妨日日寄书来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50216,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次友人韵 其三","author":"彭汝砺","text":"新诗清劲何所似，祇似金鎞刮眼开。\n流水上同知者乐，好风知是故人来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50217,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次友人韵 其四","author":"彭汝砺","text":"不但离肠夜九回，眉头十日不曾开。\n田园愈更不胜说，忆赋渊明归去来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50218,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和佛印","author":"彭汝砺","text":"黄昏云散山山雨，优钵花开处处春。\n宝塔寻常凌宇宙，灵坛咫尺觐星辰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50219,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送云居佛印禅师诗五首并偈 其一","author":"彭汝砺","text":"稍涉诸方问所归，自怜三十七年非。\n师言本自无非处，浑是真如第一机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50220,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送云居佛印禅师诗五首并偈 其二","author":"彭汝砺","text":"禅师谈实不谈虚，亦有文章水不如。\n自说金鎞元不用，谁云价重百车渠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50221,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送云居佛印禅师诗五首并偈 其三","author":"彭汝砺","text":"翠藤老木抱千山，行色归心各等闲。\n恰似白云多自在，不同飞鸟倦知还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50222,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送云居佛印禅师诗五首并偈 其四","author":"彭汝砺","text":"细磨密衲作袈裟，曲水遥岑宛转花。\n海外梯航输佛土，日边缄鐍赐禅家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50223,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送云居佛印禅师诗五首并偈 其五","author":"彭汝砺","text":"百花众宝细庄严，不是青州旧布衫。\n满载天香浮远水，遥分春色下层岩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50224,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送云居佛印禅师诗五首并偈 其六","author":"彭汝砺","text":"佛印电目海潮音，貌古瘦瘁如孤松。\n心已了达诸佛相，酬酢纵横无滞碍。\n以大慈悲为演说，登阐沈幽度众生。\n至第一义而不传，而无一义不传者。\n我今焚香赞叹礼，十方国土即闻知。\n愿师与我及众生，一切长在真实地。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50225,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁丁巳蜡祭致斋玉津东园雪中与监礼莘老学士同游西园 其一","author":"彭汝砺","text":"上苑亭台看雪飞，清寒十倍胜常时。\n腊深梅蕊争先出，风急杨花忽倒吹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50226,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁丁巳蜡祭致斋玉津东园雪中与监礼莘老学士同游西园 其二","author":"彭汝砺","text":"地禁蛟龙藏玉宇，天寒凫雁浴瑶池。\n人间合有丰年颂，不祇梁园漫赋诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50227,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁丁巳蜡祭致斋玉津东园雪中与监礼莘老学士同游西园 其三","author":"彭汝砺","text":"天上春风破雪回，好花万点斗先开。\n情知岁有元丰瑞，合得君王暇日来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50228,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁丁巳蜡祭致斋玉津东园雪中与监礼莘老学士同游西园 其四","author":"彭汝砺","text":"落雪纵横映步趋，分明身世在蓬壶。\n天家自与人间别，祇种琼花十万株。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50229,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁丁巳蜡祭致斋玉津东园雪中与监礼莘老学士同游西园 其五","author":"彭汝砺","text":"艺祖不嫌宫室卑，神孙今不剪茅茨。\n太平风俗终还厚，长似唐虞夏禹时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50230,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁丁巳蜡祭致斋玉津东园雪中与监礼莘老学士同游西园 其六","author":"彭汝砺","text":"飘飘亭观贴云浮，知是蓬瀛第几洲。\n天子焦劳游乐少，池台鱼鸟自悠悠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50231,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"北轩","author":"彭汝砺","text":"浮萍满载江湖兴，翠柏长闻金石音。\n丈室寥寥尘外事，相看真不异山林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50232,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丈室","author":"彭汝砺","text":"一似维摩万丈居，俱无未足亦无馀。\n忘言自看恒沙水，却笑临川苦羡鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50233,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"碧芦","author":"彭汝砺","text":"碧芦满眼送清秋，潇洒怜君似退休。\n一夜高风摇翠玉，五湖归梦落渔舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50234,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲至迁居同曹家西巷在蔡湖之北也 其一","author":"彭汝砺","text":"不是山林非市朝，槐阴满眼送萧条。\n公行已在青云上，乃肯吾邻共寂寥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50235,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲至迁居同曹家西巷在蔡湖之北也 其二","author":"彭汝砺","text":"里巷吾真孟母邻，齑盐知不笑清贫。\n风云祇恐公飞去，那肯淹留寂寞滨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50236,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲至迁居同曹家西巷在蔡湖之北也 其三","author":"彭汝砺","text":"陋巷本非朝市喧，亦无车马到吾门。\n清风对客忘朱夏，流水令人思故园。\n道曲柳阴低白昼，天涯月色照黄昏。\n一官彼此多闲暇，万事从容欲细论。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50237,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和元忠早春","author":"彭汝砺","text":"雨细风开草叶长，烟深日著柳梢黄。\n幽人对物心千里，玉麈朱弦宝鸭香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50238,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和初夏","author":"彭汝砺","text":"浅水池塘莲叶香，红尘道路柳阴长。\n黄梅雨裛栏干湿，翠柏风吹襟袖凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50239,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答云居佛印禅师","author":"彭汝砺","text":"江湖范蠡扁舟上，巾履维摩丈室中。\n每爱师如莲出水，却嗟予作鸟窥笼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50240,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉使丹阳途中杂言","author":"彭汝砺","text":"黄鸟频来傍水飞，杜鹃何故向人啼。\n短亭尚见临漳在，新水苍茫路欲迷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50241,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"北风","author":"彭汝砺","text":"北望南淮云更遮，别离始觉路为赊。\n深林青杏还争熟，浅水红莲亦自花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50242,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夏景","author":"彭汝砺","text":"朱明犹自有春天，野色逢迎定洒然。\n蕉叶莫虚停酒盏，杏花频委寄诗笺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50243,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浮云","author":"彭汝砺","text":"定向邮亭梦渚亭，天凉莫放酒魂醒。\n浮云不出月明白，急雨忽来天晦冥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50244,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感怀","author":"彭汝砺","text":"白头朱绂照银鱼，自笑名涂底屈纡。\n见说近来隆简素，高飞万里看鹏图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50245,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏柳","author":"彭汝砺","text":"柳色溪头相照深，诗翁收拾寄清吟。\n晚风吹散千丝缕，巧系游人夜夜心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50246,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"榆钱","author":"彭汝砺","text":"林外溪头榆荚钱，风吹个个一般圆。\n浑疑萍叶轻分去，恰似苔花碎接连。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50247,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]